						<string name="Name">README</string>
						<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[ Hello! XxMegamanxX&apos;s here to help you at making your own armor giver! Please do not republish this!
1. Make the suit
2. Put the parts on the arms/legs/torso model (not the script)
3. Test it
4. Enjoy.

Button made by constructor
README made by XxMegamanxX

I would like if you give credit to constructor but I&apos;m not going to let you.</ProtectedString>
					</Properties>
